{% set reg = "UK GDPR" if law.extra.get("uk") else "GDPR" %}
To the Data Protection Officer at {{ broker.name }}:

{{ m.agent_line(agent) }}I am writing under the {{ law.title }} to exercise my rights as a data subject.

1. Erasure (Article 17 {{ reg }}): erase all personal data concerning me without undue delay.
2. Objection to direct marketing (Article 21(2) and (3)): I object to any processing of my personal data for direct marketing, including profiling. This objection is absolute, so the data must no longer be processed for that purpose.
3. Access (Article 15): before you erase it, confirm whether you process my personal data and tell me which categories you hold, where you got them (Article 15(1)(g)), and who you disclosed them to.
4. Notification of recipients (Article 19): tell every recipient you disclosed my data to about this erasure, and tell me who they are.

Use the details below only to identify me:

{{ m.identity(person) }}{{ m.listing(listing_url) }}

Under Article 12(3), you must respond within one month of receiving this request, which is by {{ deadline }}. This request is free of charge (Article 12(5)). You may only ask for more information if you have reasonable doubts about my identity (Article 12(6)).

If I don't receive a satisfactory response, I will complain to {{ law.regulators[0].name }}.

{{ m.signoff(sender, reference) }}
